      "string_id": "bar_dolg_base_guard_talk_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Where did you naive boys come from? There's a war going on, right? We’re fighting Freedom bandits! We have regular skirmishes with their fighters in the Wild Territory.",
      "JA_current": "どこの世間知らずの坊やかと思えば……今は戦争中なんだぞ、分かってるのか？ 我々はフリーダムの盗賊どもと交戦中なのだ！ 荒廃領域でも連中の部隊としょっちゅう小競り合いを演じている。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_dolg_base_guard_talk",
